00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.130
Dug myself into a hole with no way out...

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.390
Full of regret and powerless to change,

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:09.640
I feel my heart being torn apart

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:13.390
on this night of endless shame and despair

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.610
Why can't I get my act together?

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:28.740
Got nothing but this pathetic self of mine...

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.170
