shall light your path with their blessings.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.290
'Twas absurd of me to preach the virtues of love

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:19.020
in the presence of a man 
who knows naught but lies and deceit.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.540
Realistically, I need not waste my time with a duel.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:27.310
Announcing your treacherous behavior 
to the world would bring about a swift conclusion.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.410
However!

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:36.200
My pride as an Ogre would never allow 
such an act of cowardice!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.330
I-I know that stance!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.460
What!? What's he doing, Tim!?

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.090
Yup, no doubt about it...

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:49.050
That stance... is the Gigan-style Double Tomahawk,

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:52.970
an unbeatable technique
touted by Ogrestan's fearsome army!

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:58.680
It's said that no living creature on the planet can survive 
the crushing weight with which the vortex spins.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.100
I am committed to the pursuit of true love.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:09.940
The very idea of being defeated 
by a fiend such as you is preposterous!

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:15.770
I, Antonio Spartokos,
have adored Lady Lisa since childhood.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:21.750
So that she might think of me as a man,
I have poured my efforts into honing my skills...

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:28.420
Along with maintaining 
a strict code of sexual purity!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.630
Huh?

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.050
"Purity"...?

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.890
The dude's a virgin!?

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:35.170
With a ruggedly handsome face like that!?

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.720
Give the poor guy a break, Peter...

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.680
For God's sake, show some compassion!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.640
