00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.080
Lose the fight, Peter.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.690
<i>I've never wanted to lose something
so badly in my whole life!</i>

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.850
Lose the fight, Peter.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.240
Lose the fight, Peter.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.240
<i>But...</i>

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.620
<i>What else am I supposed to do here!?</i>

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.410
Gigan-style Secret Art!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.750
Whirling Blade of Destruction!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.920
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.680
<i>I'm so sorry, Spartokos-kun!</i>

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:33.850
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.070
<i>Forgive me!</i>

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.850
It would appear...

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.910
that the victor has been decided.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.290
L-Lady Lisa!

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.980
Th-This isn't what it looks like!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.910
And what exactly does it look like?

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:49.150
Peter Grill's strength clearly exceeds your own.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:50.920
And I...

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.880
Have no interest in weaklings!

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.160
C-C'mon...

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:02.090
The guy travelled all this way for you, y'know?

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.130
There's no need to be so hard on him...

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.860
Sir Peter!

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.600
Lady Lisa, I mean it this time!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.810
Please, just one chance!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:14.210
Won't you give me one more chance!?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.610
Seeing as you're willing to beg,

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:23.110
I shall grant you one last chance 
to demonstrate your strength.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.290
Lady Lisa–!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:28.590
However, the next opponent you shall face is me.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.880
A battle with Lady Lisa herself!?

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.270
I shall postpone the match for one week.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:41.050
A fight in your present condition
would beget certain failure.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:52.390
Well, I better get going...

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.270
Sir Peter Grill!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:55.330
Huh!?

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.030
Wh-What are you doing!?

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:01.670
Please accept my sincerest apologies for the many
 transgressions I have committed against you!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:06.610
Having experienced the power of the man who conquered 
the Grand Fighting Tournament for myself,

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.780
I now know the truth!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:12.450
To be honest, back in our homeland,

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:17.050
I was never able to achieve 
favorable results in a bout against Lady Lisa...

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.820
So, uh... What's your point?

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:19.780
I beg of you!

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:24.300
Won't you consider taking me on 
as as your apprentice!?

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.810
<i>You're kiddin', right...?</i>

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.270
Please!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:32.890
You're my only hope!

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:37.330
If this duel with Lady Lisa is to be
my once-in-a-lifetime opportunity,

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.240
I cannot afford to let victory slip through my grasp!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.880
Yeah, but I...

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.780
I don't do the whole "apprentice" thing.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:47.290
Please, I beseech you! I need your help!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.790
Your pleas have been heard.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:57.360
I recommend that you accept 
the pitiful Ogre's request, Peter Grill.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:00.050
I-I, too, urge you to help him.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.730
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:04.830
It's very simple.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.290
If we were to focus our collective
efforts on training the Ogre,

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.800
we would guarantee his victory in the duel.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:17.320
Consequently, Lisa Alpacas would choose
Spartokos over you and return to her homeland!

