I believe that there's no harm in 
at least trying to work together!

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:22.630
<i>True enough...</i>

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.870
<i>I might not be able to resist 
the Ogre sisters myself,</i>

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.140
<i>but I could mount an indirect attack
by helping Spartokos-kun.</i>

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:33.160
<i>If he can manage to convince Lisa of his strength, then...</i>

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.380
All right, let's give it a try!

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:40.800
However, my lessons won't be easy.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.550
Are you prepared for that!?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.550
Yes, Sir Peter!

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:50.310
<i>Thus, the "Ogre Training Program"
had been set into motion.</i>

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:53.960
Again!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.870
Again!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:55.960
Again!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.960
Again!

