Keep going!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:58.880
Swing!

00:08:58.880 --> 00:08:59.880
Swing!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:00.940
Swing!

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.160
<i>Between Peter Grill,
the world's strongest combat instructor...</i>

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:16.180
<i>a forbidden form of muscle-enhancing 
black magic passed down amongst the Elves...</i>

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:24.290
<i>and a recipe using ingredients outlawed by
Orc society that amplifies physical strength...</i>

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.390
Me strong.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.390
Me win.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.930
Does something seem a little off to you?

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.340
Here you are, Sir Peter.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:50.530
Thanks.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.930
Well, I think it's about time for lunch.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.040
Good work out there today.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.810
That's Mitchie, the Guild receptionist...

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.540
Your kindness is most appreciated.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.300
What's she doing here?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.090
Y-You see...

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:07.550
She's been coming around 
to drop off lunch like that a lot lately.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:12.570
I-I can't help but feel as though Lady Mitchie

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:12.570
I-If you'd like, I made a little bit extra...

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.230
might be in love with Sir Spartokos...

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:37.250
It would appear that you've come prepared
with yet more training under your belt.

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:38.780
Lady Lisa...

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.080
Today is the day

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.010
that I, Spartokos,

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:47.260
shall prove my worth as a man once and for all!

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.150
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:06.190
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.820
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:12.070
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:14.160
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:17.830
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:21.040
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.460
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.420
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.800
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.510
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.970
That's good enough for me

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:37.140
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:41.020
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.440
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:45.520
And find no one like you

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:48.530
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:52.490
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:54.700
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.740
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.670
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.190
Heard you took on an apprentice. 
Color me shocked!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.760
Episode\h       Peter Grill and the Warrior that Shouted Love

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:09.750
I wouldn't mind goin' a few rounds
with you one of these days.
